+   because the stable `vllm0.19.1-rocm7.13.0` CDNA asset does not start.
 2. **Recipes.** The `Qwen3.6-27B-FP8-vLLM-{low,high}conc` and `Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8-vLLM-{low,high}conc`
